# Hand-owned files — writeProject (regen.mjs) must never overwrite or prune these.
# Everything else (src/gen/**, .gitignore) is regenerated from opencli.json.
Cargo.toml
# NOTE: the hand-owned crate-root `build.rs` (engine embed) is deliberately NOT
# listed. opencli2rust never emits a crate-root build.rs, and stale-prune only
# removes lock-tracked generated files, so it is safe from overwrite/prune with no
# entry. It cannot be listed anyway: this matcher strips a leading `/` before its
# "has a slash ⇒ anchored" test (write.ts), so any `build.rs` / `/build.rs` pattern
# collapses to an unanchored match that would wrongly shield the GENERATED
# src/gen/cmd/build.rs (the `build` command's module).
src/main.rs
src/custom/**
opencli.json
regen.mjs
.sdkignore
